{"data":{"title":"Bout' You","slug":"bout-you","path":"/artists/rainy-milo/tracks/bout-you/","artwork":"images/artists/rainy-milo/tracks/bout-you.jpg","artist":{"id":"9FTW8dflEBY","slug":"rainy-milo","links":null,"title":"Rainy Milo","artwork":null},"id":"B1cLvuLejdw"},"appearanceCount":1,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"A4s6Ct3XfkQ","show":{"id":"UMjXwUAv27s","slug":"148","title":"Soulection Radio Show #148","artwork":"/images/episodes/148.jpg","content":"\nContinuing Joe Kay's 24th birthday celibration with precise selections that you either forgot about or never heard.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nIn celebration of Joe's 24th birthday yesterday, we started celebrating on Thursday at The Sound of Tomorrow (The Crosby) with Astronautica & starRo! Thank you to everyone who came out and supported, what a show it was. This radio session is just a continuation of the celebration with precise selections that you either forgot about or never heard. \nBless to those who tuned into the live broadcast via Kbeach. It's amazing to think about how far we've came. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2013-10-12T01:00:00+00:00"}}}],"linkedPlatforms":[{"id":68087,"platform":"googlePlayMusic","href":"https://play.google.com/store/music/album?id=B5vcakohcmzst75vjgvnkrhflzi&tid=song-Tpwxecuo3ltknyvnkwetlsyg7gi","artwork":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/kNO-yULhJ-iawa_GRY47ydHb8TfC95gnYlWKA3H89e8Ru7sFCpd9wJkClBoLZ8Yte9l3LqeU3w","last_checked_at":"2020-12-15T16:54:42.602+00:00","track":"B1cLvuLejdw"},{"id":68093,"platform":"deezer","href":"https://www.deezer.com/track/137008660","artwork":"https://cdns-images.dzcdn.net/images/cover/41f9cde362cd88840097b35f5e478128/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","last_checked_at":"2020-12-15T16:54:41.949+00:00","track":"B1cLvuLejdw"},{"id":68099,"platform":"soundcloud","href":"https://soundcloud.com/rainymilo/bout-you","artwork":"https://i1.sndcdn.com/artworks-000031135050-ickbje-lar